    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Repeats";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Repeating actions for dealing with misconduct";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "Taking legal proceedings, disciplinary proceedings or other administrative action is an example of dealing with matters described in paragraphs (a), (b), (c) and (d).";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Dealing with misconduct may involve repeating actions such as taking legal proceedings.";
